# Fixture input for `cctally explain`.
# AS_OF pins the measured-at instant; FLAGS pin the window and provider.
# The window token is INCLUSIVE of its end date, so 08-10..08-16 is the
# half-open [2026-08-10T00:00:00Z, 2026-08-17T00:00:00Z) the builder seeds.
AS_OF="2026-08-17T00:00:00Z"
FLAGS="--window 2026-08-10..2026-08-16 --source codex"
